}

docs {
  # Batch Presigned Upload URLs (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch/presigned-upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Requests direct upload URLs for multiple files simultaneously (up to 50 items).
}
